WEBVTT

00:07.472 --> 00:11.559
Don't lay a finger on those dice,
Josuke Higashikata!

00:13.394 --> 00:15.521
Stay absolutely still.

00:16.356 --> 00:18.316
<i>What's he gonna do now?</i>

00:18.399 --> 00:21.402
<i>If he finds out I've been cheating…</i>

00:21.444 --> 00:22.987
<i>Knowing him,</i>

00:23.071 --> 00:26.115
<i>a simple apology won't be enough.</i>

00:28.451 --> 00:30.244
So what are you looking for?

00:30.286 --> 00:31.787
It could be my imagination,

00:31.871 --> 00:35.040
but I could swear the dice
are staring at me.

00:35.250 --> 00:36.292
<i>Gulp.</i>

00:37.919 --> 00:39.170
<i>Ba-dum, ba-dum…</i>

00:39.921 --> 00:44.091
Hmph. Well, in any case.
Let's continue the game.

00:44.133 --> 00:47.302
ROHAN… ADDS 30 CHIPS

00:47.679 --> 00:50.973
W-Well, you're braver than me…
Just two here.

00:52.433 --> 00:54.935
<i>Catch my drift now, Mr. Alien?</i>

00:55.144 --> 00:56.812
<i>By hook or by crook, I gotta win.</i>

00:56.938 --> 00:59.857
<i>I have to come out
just a little bit ahead.</i>

01:00.483 --> 01:02.026
<i>All right, go!</i>

01:05.655 --> 01:09.325
<i>This guy just doesn't get it!</i>

01:11.953 --> 01:14.789
Guess that's what you call
a streak of luck.

01:18.251 --> 01:21.045
Rolling that score more than once
is certainly possible.

01:23.631 --> 01:25.924
An omen is worth five times
the initial bet, yes?

01:26.342 --> 01:27.426
You'll get your cash.

01:27.468 --> 01:29.386
The dice will do what they do.

01:31.973 --> 01:35.851
Right… I guess strokes of luck
do happen, as they say.

01:48.406 --> 01:50.074
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

01:50.783 --> 01:52.868
<i>(Listen up)
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

01:53.661 --> 01:55.579
<i>(Listen)
Breakdown, Breakdown</i>

01:56.831 --> 01:59.917
<i>Breakdown, Breakdown
(3, 2, 1) Let's Go!</i>

02:00.001 --> 02:01.127
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

02:01.169 --> 02:05.669
<i>Shining Justice begins to sprout</i>

02:06.716 --> 02:11.216
<i>Brand-new bed town
Will we meet? Let's find out</i>

02:12.388 --> 02:16.888
<i>Feeling the sea breeze from the cape
through the tunnel to the tower</i>

02:18.019 --> 02:22.519
<i>We wander into the alley,
drawn to each other</i>

02:23.316 --> 02:27.816
<i>A shadow melts into our hearts</i>

02:30.698 --> 02:35.198
<i>But the golden spirits
shine a light to protect us</i>

02:40.541 --> 02:45.041
<i>Let the voice of love
take you higher</i>

02:45.546 --> 02:50.046
<i>Let the gathering forces
overcome time itself</i>

02:51.886 --> 02:56.386
<i>1999 Bizarre Summer</i>

02:56.849 --> 03:01.349
<i>Our courage keeps the town in bloom</i>

03:02.397 --> 03:06.609
<i>Great Days</i>

03:09.195 --> 03:12.698
EPISODE 28
HIGHWAY GO GO, PART 1

03:09.904 --> 03:12.720
W-W-Wha…

03:13.074 --> 03:15.159
What the hell are you doing?!

03:15.410 --> 03:19.455
I don't know how,
but you are cheating.

03:19.497 --> 03:20.539
It's unacceptable…

03:20.581 --> 03:22.958
It's unacceptable
that I cannot figure it out!

03:23.042 --> 03:25.210
You're freakin' insane!

03:25.336 --> 03:26.962
You're insufferable.

03:27.004 --> 03:29.548
I've been diligent
in restraining myself,

03:29.590 --> 03:31.425
for Mr. Joestar and Koichi's sakes,

03:31.634 --> 03:35.304
but now you've gone
and made it personal.

03:35.888 --> 03:40.142
You're probably gloating inside,
and it makes me sick.

03:40.268 --> 03:43.354
Give me your hand.
I'll have Shining Diamond fix it.

03:43.438 --> 03:44.439
Silence now!

03:45.106 --> 03:48.818
Do you have any idea
why I did that to my little finger?

03:49.110 --> 03:53.531
So you can't back out of the game,
Josuke Higashikata!

03:54.323 --> 03:58.702
I refuse to let a chowderhead like
you disrespect the great Rohan!

04:00.246 --> 04:02.748
We play one more time each.

04:02.874 --> 04:06.836
In that time, I will see through
your method of deception.

04:07.044 --> 04:10.714
Of course, if I cannot
see through your deception…

04:11.632 --> 04:13.800
Before you is two million yen.

04:13.843 --> 04:18.180
Consider it monetary incentive
for treatment by Shining Diamond.

04:19.098 --> 04:22.601
However, if I do uncover
the nature of your deception,

04:22.810 --> 04:27.189
Your little finger is mine,
Josuke Higashikata.

04:28.983 --> 04:32.444
Hey, you two seem to be
enjoying yourselves.

04:34.155 --> 04:38.117
Hey, it's me.
Long time no see, Josuke!

04:38.326 --> 04:41.078
I was stuck in the hospital
for a month.

04:41.454 --> 04:43.664
It's all kinda fuzzy,

04:43.706 --> 04:46.375
supposedly I slammed my
head against the side of the road.

04:46.542 --> 04:47.543
Tamami?

04:47.585 --> 04:50.045
What are you
poking around here for?

04:50.087 --> 04:54.174
I gave him a call and
hired him as a repo man of sorts.

04:54.425 --> 04:55.551
Repo man?

04:56.135 --> 04:58.095
Tamami Kobayashi at your service.

04:58.179 --> 05:00.264
I promise you I will exact
the agreed upon items

05:00.348 --> 05:03.059
swiftly and without fail,

05:03.434 --> 05:07.855
with my trusty soul-affixing lock.

05:09.273 --> 05:13.773
I will fulfill my duty,
regardless of the victor.

05:13.986 --> 05:17.781
My fee is 20%, or 400,000 yen,
whichever is larger.

05:17.865 --> 05:19.575
You both play once more,

05:19.617 --> 05:22.786
and Rohan here tries to determine
the method of deception, yes?

05:23.037 --> 05:23.871
Yes.

05:23.955 --> 05:24.830
What?!

05:25.081 --> 05:29.210
Then again, you could
be tempted to withhold your trick,

05:29.710 --> 05:31.962
so I will make sure
you cannot act on that urge.

05:32.171 --> 05:34.631
Should you win without cheating,

05:35.007 --> 05:39.507
Tamami's lock will
automatically besiege you.

05:40.721 --> 05:43.890
<i>Now I'm really up shit creek…
It's now or never!</i>

05:44.350 --> 05:47.644
<i>I've gotta pull off this trick,
and get myself outta this mess!</i>

05:48.855 --> 05:51.774
So it's settled… I'll go first.

05:57.071 --> 05:58.238
How's that?!

06:00.449 --> 06:01.241
A four!

06:01.993 --> 06:03.452
A pair of three's and a four!

06:04.912 --> 06:08.248
<i>Thank god!
Finally, a normal result for once.</i>

06:08.332 --> 06:09.791
<i>He won't figure it out now.</i>

06:12.253 --> 06:14.838
So it's my turn next, right guys?

06:15.256 --> 06:18.342
Hmph. You look as though a weight's
been lifted off your shoulders.

06:18.551 --> 06:23.013
Like a task you requested
of someone was a success.

06:23.389 --> 06:24.306
<i>Just stay calm.</i>

06:24.348 --> 06:26.183
<i>That bastard Rohan
doesn't have a clue.</i>

06:26.434 --> 06:28.269
<i>I'm gonna do this!</i>

06:33.274 --> 06:34.608
<i>Is that barf?!</i>

06:35.026 --> 06:38.446
<i>Shit! He's getting dizzy!</i>

06:39.113 --> 06:41.740
<i>It's from all of Rohan's shaking.</i>

06:41.949 --> 06:45.118
Josuke! Take your hand
away from the dice.

06:45.286 --> 06:46.036
Huh?

06:46.078 --> 06:47.662
I can't see them.

06:47.830 --> 06:51.458
Shake the dice with your palm open.

06:53.794 --> 06:56.296
Huh? Must be a fire somewhere.

06:59.133 --> 07:01.385
W-What? Sirens?!

07:02.511 --> 07:05.430
<i>Th-This freak's allergic
to the sound of sirens.</i>

07:05.765 --> 07:08.642
<i>Crap! He's gonna revert back!</i>

07:08.684 --> 07:10.811
What are you doing?
You're acting strange!

07:11.103 --> 07:13.146
Show me what you're hiding
in that hand now!

07:14.982 --> 07:17.651
That, my friends,
was a spontaneous battle cry!

07:17.693 --> 07:19.236
Now get ready to be blown away!

07:19.320 --> 07:20.946
Go! Do it!

07:29.830 --> 07:31.998
It's a 666 omen!

07:32.166 --> 07:35.502
The lock didn't activate.
Josuke is cheating!

07:38.005 --> 07:41.049
Well? Did you figure it out,
Rohan-sensei?

07:47.223 --> 07:51.227
Is this an admission of defeat,
Rohan-sensei?

07:52.520 --> 07:55.397
<i>Looks like those weird
little dots aren't on Rohan's side.</i>

07:55.606 --> 07:56.815
<i>Just a little longer!</i>

07:57.650 --> 08:02.150
Did you figure it out or not?

08:03.948 --> 08:04.865
<i>Shit, shit, shit…</i>

08:06.033 --> 08:08.076
That's… I've got it!

08:09.120 --> 08:09.912
<i>I'm through!</i>

08:09.996 --> 08:12.873
I've got it! The fire's here!

08:12.915 --> 08:13.582
Huh?!

08:13.582 --> 08:16.585
Rohan-sensei, your house is
burning to the ground!

08:18.379 --> 08:19.713
It was the magnifying glass!

08:19.755 --> 08:21.965
The magnifying glass
started the fire!

08:22.174 --> 08:24.259
We were too distracted by the game!

08:24.969 --> 08:28.263
Shut up! I don't care
if it ends up a heap of ash!

08:28.305 --> 08:31.099
The important thing is that I
figure out how Josuke is cheating!

08:31.183 --> 08:32.809
That's freak in crazy talk!

08:32.893 --> 08:35.103
Escape now,
and take your two million!

08:35.312 --> 08:37.105
W-Well, I'll be going now…

08:37.314 --> 08:38.565
Wait, Josuke!

08:38.607 --> 08:42.110
But first,
I'm gonna fix that finger.

08:42.278 --> 08:44.321
Who asked you to do that…

08:44.739 --> 08:47.783
Josuke, wait! You bastard!

08:49.577 --> 08:51.287
That was close…

08:51.328 --> 08:54.664
I guess I'm the kind of guy that
some people just love to hate, huh?

08:54.749 --> 08:56.250
Who knew…

08:56.333 --> 08:58.335
You seem rather down.

08:58.586 --> 09:00.713
Was I of assistance?

09:01.380 --> 09:03.757
Just be quiet, jeez!

09:03.883 --> 09:08.383
ROHAN KISHIBE'S HOUSE: HALF BURNED
7,000,000 YEN IN FIRE DAMAGE
JOSUKE MAY HAVE ESCAPED UNSCATHED,
BUT HE MANAGED TO GET
EVEN FURTHER ON ROHAN'S BAD SIDE.

09:04.300 --> 09:08.262
<i>Rohan Kishibe's house: half burned
7, 000, 000 yen in fire damage.</i>

09:08.596 --> 09:10.931
<i>Josuke may have escaped unscathed,</i>

09:11.098 --> 09:14.726
<i>but he managed to get
even further on Rohan's bad side.</i>

09:18.189 --> 09:20.691
KAWAJIRI KOSAKU
SHINOBU
HAYATO

09:21.067 --> 09:23.861
<i>Just a reminder to
all you drivers out there</i>

09:23.944 --> 09:26.321
<i>to be extra careful on the road</i>

09:26.739 --> 09:28.615
<i>Seems a motorcycle crashed</i>

09:28.657 --> 09:30.950
<i>at the entrance of
Futatsumori Tunnel yesterday,</i>

09:31.035 --> 09:33.662
<i>and the young rider was badly injured.</i>

09:33.829 --> 09:36.164
<i>Police later found out…</i>

09:36.582 --> 09:38.917
<i>Recently, Mom's been different.</i>

09:39.585 --> 09:42.421
<i>Dressing up, new lipstick,</i>

09:42.797 --> 09:44.131
<i>She's happy…</i>

09:47.301 --> 09:49.094
<i>Did something happen?</i>

09:53.599 --> 09:58.099
It's been a while since Mom
got naked in front of Dad.

10:02.441 --> 10:06.695
Am I the product of parents
who love each other?

10:08.531 --> 10:10.991
What's he doing?

10:12.952 --> 10:16.622
<i>Josuke Higashikata… Jotaro Kujo…</i>

10:17.206 --> 10:19.708
<i>They're the reason I'm in this mess.</i>

10:29.218 --> 10:32.429
Oh, Josuke.
My thanks for yesterday.

10:32.638 --> 10:36.600
So what'd you end up doing
for sleeping and eating yesterday?

10:36.684 --> 10:38.769
Mikitaka! Mikitaka!

10:39.145 --> 10:41.564
Now I want you to stay by my side!

10:42.189 --> 10:46.026
We just moved here, and there are
lots of errands to do.

10:46.235 --> 10:48.904
All right, Mother.
I'll be right there.

10:48.988 --> 10:49.989
H-Huh?

10:50.364 --> 10:53.950
Don't tell me you're telling people
you're an alien again…

10:54.034 --> 10:56.453
You're playing pranks
on people again, aren't you…

10:57.037 --> 10:59.873
I'm sorry if he bothered you.
Pay no attention to him.

10:59.999 --> 11:03.043
At his last school in Tokyo,
people actually took him seriously,

11:03.085 --> 11:05.045
He caused such a scene.

11:06.297 --> 11:08.007
Now, if you'll excuse us.

11:08.549 --> 11:10.551
Huh? What?!

11:11.677 --> 11:15.639
I brainwashed her into
thinking that I'm her son.

11:15.890 --> 11:19.602
"Mikitaka Hazekura"
is my alias here on Earth.

11:20.060 --> 11:20.894
See ya!

11:20.936 --> 11:23.646
Mikitaka! Get over here now!

11:21.353 --> 11:23.813
MIKITAKA HAZEKURA…
ALIEN OR STAND USER?!

11:24.440 --> 11:26.066
H-Huh?

11:26.108 --> 11:27.400
Huh?!

11:28.652 --> 11:30.528
What was that?

11:30.571 --> 11:32.573
Just who was that oddball brat?

11:32.907 --> 11:35.034
Is he truly an alien?

11:35.075 --> 11:37.118
Or is he a Stand user I created

11:37.203 --> 11:39.455
when I threw the arrow at him
and cut his neck?

11:39.496 --> 11:42.290
The way he was able to
drive a wedge

11:42.333 --> 11:44.585
between Josuke and Rohan
was impressive…

11:44.627 --> 11:46.295
But!

11:46.420 --> 11:49.464
Next time it will be the Stand,
Highway Go Go…

11:49.548 --> 11:52.759
It will crush the slime trying to
hunt down my son!

12:11.612 --> 12:13.572
Why can't you look at me?

12:13.739 --> 12:15.574
You could at least say hello.

12:15.783 --> 12:20.283
You know, I am older than you,
Josuke Higashikata.

12:23.624 --> 12:25.042
Sorry about yesterday.

12:25.125 --> 12:27.585
That fire sure was something else.

12:27.753 --> 12:31.673
Yes. Just like in
the movie <i>Pretty Woman,</i>

12:31.757 --> 12:34.843
I lost about 2,500,000 yen
worth of furniture.

12:35.219 --> 12:37.471
Not that any of that bothers me.

12:38.806 --> 12:41.225
So what's wrong? Take a seat.

12:45.229 --> 12:49.729
<i>I swear I will repay you
for yesterday's game.</i>

12:54.613 --> 12:55.614
What?

12:56.657 --> 12:58.033
That was…

12:58.200 --> 12:59.826
Josuke, did you see that?

12:59.868 --> 13:02.412
There was a door to a house
in the tunnel wall.

13:02.496 --> 13:04.122
Someone's inside!

13:06.375 --> 13:07.542
There's a window, too!

13:07.751 --> 13:09.544
Beyond these tunnel walls
is a room.

13:09.628 --> 13:11.713
And someone is living in it!

13:14.800 --> 13:16.009
There's a man, too!

13:16.218 --> 13:17.761
But I can't see their faces!

13:18.012 --> 13:20.222
What is he doing?!

13:28.439 --> 13:30.107
Josuke, did you see that?!

13:30.190 --> 13:32.108
Just shut your face, Rohan Kishibe!

13:32.192 --> 13:35.153
Don't think you can go on
screwing with me forever!

13:37.614 --> 13:39.699
Can no one else see it?

13:43.412 --> 13:46.581
<i>Is that house… a new Stand user?</i>

13:46.790 --> 13:48.833
<i>The man who cut off that woman's hand…</i>

13:48.876 --> 13:49.918
<i>Could he be…</i>

13:50.252 --> 13:51.920
<i>Yoshikage Kira?!</i>

13:55.466 --> 13:59.470
MORIOH LANDMARK 8
"FUTATSUMORI TUNNEL"
COMPLETED IN THE YEAR KAEI 5 (1852),
AND RESTORED IN SHOWA 28,
THE TUNNEL STRETCHES SOME
450 METERS LONG AND
CONNECTS S CITY WITH MORIOH.
ITS CURVED LAYOUT OBSCURES
THE EXIT FROM THE ENTRANCE,
AND ITS LACK OF LIGHT HAS BEEN
THE CAUSE OF NUMEROUS ACCIDENTS.
MOST OF THE AREA'S YOUNGER
POPULATION THINK IT'S HAUNTED.

14:05.434 --> 14:09.271
FUTATSUMORI
TUNNEL

14:06.518 --> 14:09.270
You're telling me a room
was inside the tunnel?!

14:09.688 --> 14:11.022
You're not fooling me!

14:11.065 --> 14:14.526
Is that half-baked lie
your way of getting back at me?

14:14.735 --> 14:17.863
So you have no faith in what
I'm saying, Josuke Higashikata?

14:19.031 --> 14:21.658
Says the liar who cheats with dice…

14:21.742 --> 14:25.620
Says the liar who says one thing
and does another…

14:25.662 --> 14:28.039
You dare have the gall
to accuse me of being a liar?

14:28.582 --> 14:31.459
You and I are
completely different people.

14:31.543 --> 14:32.794
You wouldn't understand

14:32.836 --> 14:34.879
even if I took you back there
to see it myself.

14:38.801 --> 14:41.136
All right, let's go.

15:02.116 --> 15:03.283
That's the exit.

15:08.956 --> 15:10.332
Nothing at all.

15:10.499 --> 15:13.335
Nothing but a wall.

15:14.336 --> 15:16.338
So it was just an illusion.

15:18.757 --> 15:19.758
What?!

15:19.341 --> 15:20.842
CRASH

15:23.053 --> 15:24.512
Th-This is…

15:24.972 --> 15:27.516
This is the room
I saw from the bus.

15:31.979 --> 15:33.939
It appeared out of thin air!

15:34.148 --> 15:36.984
But the man and woman are gone.

15:46.952 --> 15:49.204
Blast it! Something's there!

15:49.413 --> 15:51.873
So this room is a trap!

15:53.041 --> 15:55.668
It's getting closer…
Something's definitely here!

15:56.044 --> 15:58.504
I don't see a thing,
but something's heading toward me!

16:01.592 --> 16:04.261
Something came close.

16:04.344 --> 16:07.722
It was invisible,
but I know it moved toward me.

16:07.848 --> 16:10.225
Something nonhuman.

16:10.267 --> 16:11.601
That room was bait.

16:11.685 --> 16:14.312
That Kira-looking fellow
was an illusion.

16:15.147 --> 16:17.649
There's no question
that room is a Stand.

16:17.691 --> 16:20.402
Going it alone is risky.
I should tell Mr. Joestar…

16:23.447 --> 16:25.407
Shit. It's coming after me!

16:27.868 --> 16:29.202
What is that?!

16:29.244 --> 16:31.746
These… These look like footprints…

16:31.788 --> 16:33.164
They're the Stand?

16:34.750 --> 16:36.710
60km/h!

16:37.961 --> 16:39.253
I lost it.

16:39.338 --> 16:42.924
So it can't run faster than 60km/h.

16:43.175 --> 16:44.759
Long-range Stand…

16:50.807 --> 16:51.766
What?!

16:51.850 --> 16:53.643
Damn! It caught up to me!

16:53.727 --> 16:55.603
I lowered my speed by a fraction!

16:57.147 --> 16:58.940
Bastard…

16:59.024 --> 17:00.692
I'll turn it into a book
and take control!

17:00.734 --> 17:02.277
Heaven's Door!

17:05.239 --> 17:08.909
<i>No… It's sapping my strength…</i>

17:11.411 --> 17:15.623
I was hoping
I'd never see Rohan again,

17:15.916 --> 17:17.792
but here I am.

17:17.876 --> 17:22.005
Guess this liar who never follows
through has a heart after all.

17:27.427 --> 17:28.428
What?!

17:30.764 --> 17:33.266
W-Wait… C-Could this be…

17:33.308 --> 17:35.601
Rohan's motorcycle?
<i>Only</i> his motorcycle?!

17:35.894 --> 17:36.936
SMASH

17:42.109 --> 17:43.819
This monster…

17:43.902 --> 17:48.402
Give me nourishment…
Become my nourishment!

17:48.782 --> 17:50.533
Heaven's Door!

17:51.451 --> 17:53.953
The Stand's name is Highway Go Go.

17:53.996 --> 17:55.539
That room was a trap.

17:55.747 --> 17:58.166
It hunts down anyone
curious enough to enter that room,

17:58.250 --> 18:00.252
then pursues them like a rabid dog,

18:00.502 --> 18:04.506
before relentlessly draining
its victim of all its nutrients.

18:04.673 --> 18:08.134
Once Highway Go Go touches you,
its weakness…

18:08.218 --> 18:10.011
Its weakness…

18:10.887 --> 18:13.014
d-disappears?!

18:14.558 --> 18:17.561
I-It's no use…
I've lost my strength.

18:17.686 --> 18:19.145
I can't even read.

18:19.187 --> 18:22.190
He's depleting more and more
of my strength…

18:22.232 --> 18:25.068
Writing in a command is impossible…

18:25.485 --> 18:27.695
I can't…

18:28.447 --> 18:29.448
Rohan!

18:30.490 --> 18:33.034
Hey, are you here, Rohan?!

18:33.327 --> 18:36.288
Josuke… you actually came back…

18:36.455 --> 18:37.873
So you have a friend…

18:37.956 --> 18:41.459
Your name is Rohan?

18:45.964 --> 18:49.550
Hey, Rohan! Answer me!
Where are you?

18:49.718 --> 18:50.760
Rohan!

18:53.430 --> 18:54.931
Th-That's…

18:56.683 --> 18:58.559
R-Rohan?!

18:59.436 --> 19:01.312
Go ahead, Rohan…

19:01.355 --> 19:04.024
Call out to your friend
to save you.

19:04.066 --> 19:06.026
- What the hell is this?
- Shout out for help.

19:06.068 --> 19:07.319
You okay?!

19:07.361 --> 19:11.861
I've left just a fraction of
your body's nutrients behind.

19:12.240 --> 19:16.740
If you agree to cry to him
for help, I'll spare you your life.

19:17.704 --> 19:20.915
I'll simply deplete him
of his nutrients instead.

19:21.750 --> 19:26.250
Now… Make this easy
and lure him into the room.

19:28.757 --> 19:33.219
I'll let you live.
Hurry and get him in here.

19:33.261 --> 19:35.054
What the hell is this place?

19:35.097 --> 19:37.933
It looks like
someone's living here!

19:37.974 --> 19:39.892
Come on and spit it out.

19:39.935 --> 19:43.605
Look! He's having second thoughts,
he's gonna end up leaving.

19:43.689 --> 19:47.109
It's not like you two actually
care about each other, do you?

19:47.150 --> 19:49.944
Now ask him to save you.

19:51.947 --> 19:53.782
Do you want to die?

19:54.241 --> 19:57.285
I-If I bait him into coming here…

19:57.577 --> 19:59.912
If I give him to you…

20:00.080 --> 20:04.501
w-will you really…

20:04.668 --> 20:06.461
spare my life?

20:10.173 --> 20:12.300
Of course, I promise.

20:12.384 --> 20:13.635
A little give-and-take.

20:13.719 --> 20:15.971
You get me his nutrients,
I give you your life.

20:16.304 --> 20:19.348
Summon him. Lure him here now!

20:20.392 --> 20:21.893
Close, but no cigar.

20:22.477 --> 20:23.352
What?!

20:23.437 --> 20:26.815
You should know that one of
Kishibe Rohan's favorite things

20:26.857 --> 20:31.357
is saying "no" to
extremely powerful people.

20:32.279 --> 20:34.155
Run, Josuke!

20:34.656 --> 20:36.866
If you enter this room,
you're done for!

20:36.950 --> 20:38.034
You'll be killed!

20:39.327 --> 20:41.996
You bastard!

20:46.084 --> 20:48.544
Do you really think
I'm the kind of person

20:48.628 --> 20:50.921
who always does as he's told?

20:50.964 --> 20:52.674
I'll give this dickwad
a proper beating.

20:52.924 --> 20:54.300
Where is he?

20:54.342 --> 20:56.594
Where's this sneaky bastard hiding?

20:57.262 --> 20:58.263
W—

20:58.305 --> 21:01.516
What do you think you're doing,
Josuke Higashikata?

21:01.558 --> 21:03.893
I just told you he's deadly…

21:04.102 --> 21:07.647
You always do the exact opposite
of what I'm thinking.

21:07.689 --> 21:10.483
That's why I despise you.

21:10.859 --> 21:13.361
That's why you bug
the shit out of me!

21:13.403 --> 21:14.904
He's going to attack you!

21:15.071 --> 21:18.199
He already has hold of your scent!

21:18.033 --> 21:19.576
SMASH
CRUSH
SMASH

21:20.118 --> 21:22.161
Yes! My feast begins!

21:22.579 --> 21:24.872
Heaven's Door!

21:25.999 --> 21:28.126
YOUR BODY WILL FLY
BACKWARDS AT 70 km/h!

21:30.295 --> 21:34.795
Josuke, Highway Go Go will
follow you anywhere at 60km/h!

21:35.550 --> 21:37.009
Look for the user!

21:37.052 --> 21:40.472
Your only way out of this
is to defeat the user!

21:40.514 --> 21:43.934
You just don't shut up, do you!

21:45.519 --> 21:47.229
Rohan!

21:56.238 --> 21:57.656
Rohan Kishibe…

21:57.697 --> 22:00.491
Wow, so you actually saved me…

22:00.534 --> 22:05.034
I'm speechless… I'm speechless
and pretty damn choked up!

22:08.750 --> 22:11.377
All right, Rohan.

22:11.670 --> 22:14.422
I just have to find
that thing's user, right?

22:16.007 --> 22:17.758
Find him

22:17.843 --> 22:20.262
and beat his soul sucking ass
to kingdom come!

22:22.681 --> 22:24.641
Hang in there, Rohan!

23:38.840 --> 23:42.009
EPISODE 29
HIGHWAY GO GO, PART 2
